  'Plan B sin bomba': 'Plan B without a pump',
  'Si la bomba falla lejos de casa, tienes que poder pasar a ponerte la insulina con pluma.':
      'If the pump fails far from home, you need to be able to switch to taking your insulin with a pen.',
